    {
        "content": "<p><span class=\"user-mention silent\" data-user-id=\"214703\">Yury G. Kudryashov</span> <a href=\"#narrow/channel/287929-mathlib4/topic/Inverse.20function.20theorem.20and.20ContinuousLinearEquiv/near/568371521\">said</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I think that we should have different constructions of <code>ImplicitFunctionData</code> in <code>Calculus/ImplicitFunction/*.lean</code>.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>That’s fine. Probably easier that way.</p>",
